%% seq_05_org_membership_overview.mmd
%% Updated 2026-06-26 (verified).
%% Reader intent: Understand the major organization membership sequences without opening each membership action first.
%% Key boundary: Overview covers invite, role/remove administration, and join-request lifecycle at a summary level only.
%% Current caveat: Current-organization switching is related to membership but intentionally lives outside this overview because it is workspace-context behavior, not membership mutation.
%% Runtime caveat: Join-request lifecycle should be read as pending membership behavior first, not as a guaranteed separate request-table flow.

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor O as Org Owner/Admin
    actor U as User
    participant UI as Browser
    participant C as Controllers
    participant Cmd as Commands

    Note over O,Cmd: INVITE / ROLE / REMOVE FLOWS
    O->>UI: Execute membership administration actions
    UI->>C: /org/members/* and related org routes
    C->>Cmd: Invite, update role, remove member
    C-->>UI: Success/error state

    Note over U,Cmd: JOIN REQUEST FLOW
    U->>UI: Submit join request
    UI->>C: /organizations/:organizationId/join
    C->>Cmd: Create/process pending membership
    C-->>UI: Pending/approved/rejected state
